Hi we're Taras and Olga! 
- We are flexible, kind, peaceful;
- We like art, music and books;
- And travel :)
And we like our beautiful home in Toronto. 
Please come, relax, enjoy!

Active, sociable, friendly;
Travel enthusiast with a total of 50,000 km of travel experience;
Exploratory before/during travel, respectful and attentive as a guest;
